# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SGI/IRIX PROM reference sources.  These are SGI's proprietary
# leaked firmware sources; hello_tune-player does not need them
# to build or run (all parameters are transcribed in
# py/hellotune/tunes.py).  Keep your local copy of the PROM trees
# under ref/ -- it is intentionally not tracked so the published
# repo carries only this project's original code.
#
# (Delete these two lines if you really do want to publish ref/.)
ref/
!ref/.gitkeep
